[{"title":"游涪溪","author":"宋之源","text":"不因党论到元符，安得溪山著一儒。\n时有诎伸须直道，天开灵杰岂归愚。\n泉疏阴涧诗馀派，手拓苍崖节转孤。\n自送江西仙袂远，神游应过此间无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45736,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙鼻水泉","author":"宋习之","text":"老龙倦雷霆，奔山化为石。\n惟有鼻不枯，尚留云雨迹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45737,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"宋中行","text":"路转五盘知地远，铺名太薄见人情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45738,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小冲山/小重山","author":"宋丰之","text":"花样妖娆柳样柔。\n眼波流不断、满眶秋。\n窥人佯整玉搔头。\n娇无力，舞罢却成羞。\n无计与迟留。\n满怀禁不得、许多愁。\n一溪春水送行舟。\n无情月，偏照水东楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45739,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赐武元亨","author":"赵祯","text":"只向身边有大还，胎神月殿在秋天。\n三灵密像谁分别，尺质清虚本自然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45740,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛牙赞","author":"赵祯","text":"三皇掩质皆归土，五帝潜形已化尘。\n夫子域中誇是圣，老君世上亦言真。\n埋躯祗见空遗冢，何处将身示后人。\n唯有吾师金骨在，曾经百鍊色长新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45741,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幸资善堂","author":"赵祯","text":"先皇教善敞东闱，菲德承宗赖庆晖。\n为感储筵惊岁月，因瞻台像驻骖騑。\n楹书乍启钦遗泽，庭树重攀记旧围。\n畴日学文亲政地，仰怀慈训倍依依。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45742,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送李端懿帅郓","author":"赵祯","text":"鲁馆名臣子，皇家外弟亲。\n诗书谋帅旧，金竹剖符新。\n九郡提封远，一圻甘泽均。\n纯诚宜报国，抚士爱吾民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45743,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽刘沆","author":"赵祯","text":"早富经纶业，终成辅弼功。\n立朝无党势，为国尽公忠。\n此日悲遗直，谁人嗣匪躬。\n深嗟亡一鉴，何以慰予衷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45744,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莲花经赞","author":"赵祯","text":"六万馀言七轴装，无边妙义内含藏。\n溢心甘露时时润，灌顶醍醐滴滴凉。\n白玉齿边流舍利，红莲舌上放毫光。\n假饶造罪如山岳，只消妙法两三行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45745,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赏花钓鱼","author":"赵祯","text":"晴旭辉辉苑籞开，氤氲花气好风来。\n游丝罥絮萦行仗，堕蕊飘香入酒杯。\n鱼跃文波时拨剌，莺留深树久徘徊。\n青春朝野方无事，故许游观近侍陪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45746,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赐刘煇及第","author":"赵祯","text":"治世求才重，公朝校艺精。\n临轩升造士，入彀得群英。\n并蹑云梯峻，联登桂籍荣。\n庇民思善政，慈惠体予情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45747,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赐梅挚知杭州","author":"赵祯","text":"地有湖山美，东南第一州。\n剖符宣政化，持橐辍才流。\n暂出论思列，遥分旰昃忧。\n循良勤抚俗，来暮听歌讴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45748,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉祐六年八月十五日赐林悦 其二","author":"赵祯","text":"郡莆卿家名望族，三仁而下爵王公。\n存孤实抗回天义，报国常摅贯日忠。\n德润丰姿人有异，光增谱牒世无同。\n古今纪载难穷尽，一代强如一代隆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45749,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉祐六年八月十五日赐林悦 其一","author":"赵祯","text":"长林派出下邳先，移入闽邦远更延。\n忠孝有声天地老，古今无数子孙贤。\n故家乔木盘根大，新出猗兰奕叶鲜。\n上下相承同纪载，三千年后万千年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45750,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"赵祯","text":"恩袍草色动，仙籍桂香浮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45751,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"赵祯","text":"寒儒逢景运，报德合如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45752,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"宋公愿","text":"水色长天人世外，秋风斜日钓舟归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45753,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽吕东莱先生 其四","author":"宋天则","text":"丽泽南轩聚，俱曾辱异知。\n颛蒙初自释，诱掖信吾斯。\n虽叹行窝寂，犹亏筑室思。\n祇同二三子，许学莫能移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45754,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽吕东莱先生 其二","author":"宋天则","text":"世选仍收第，词科复处优。\n贤关资善教，东观迈英游。\n史笔精刊系，文编极简搜。\n家居期问董，岂料病无瘳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45755,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽吕东莱先生 其三","author":"宋天则","text":"设心何正大，所乐得群英。\n文妙云龙变，经谈日月明。\n精觕无间断，小大各圆成。\n长育恩难报，攀号自失声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45756,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽吕东莱先生 其一","author":"宋天则","text":"含孕天资粹，稽参学力深。\n躬纯君子行，道会圣人心。\n形见温于玉，持存劲愈金。\n斯文方有赖，蚤作遽闻音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45757,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太平兴国七年季冬大雪赐学士","author":"赵炅","text":"轻轻相亚凝如酥，宫树花装万万株。\n今赐酒卿时一盏，玉堂闲话道情无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45758,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"述字回文偈七首 其二","author":"赵炅","text":"求比旧前忧，依述最亨知。\n休以祐然留，希佛背生推。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45759,"sha